<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar panel to review cane molasses duty.</title>
<headline>EU sugar panel to review cane molasses duty.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will review the import duty on cane molasses on Wednesday, a European Commission official said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are indications that the long-term world market price is downwards,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The import duty on beet molasses has remained at zero but cane molasses has been subject to a small fluctuating import duty since earlier this year.</p>
<p>Last week (Aug 29) the committee raised the import duty duty to 0.11 Ecus per 100 kg from 0.4 Ecus per 100kg on August 22.</p>
<p>The committee will also consider the usual weekly tenders. --Brussels newsroom, +32 2 287-6830</p>
